tate":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-06-12T06:52:46Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:07Z","closed_at":"2025-11-13T23:47:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107440","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107440","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107440.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107440.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-13T23:47:52Z"},"body":"Currently, the `tab_rmb_clicked` signal only works when `select_with_rmb` is enabled. This is not always wanted however, say if you wanted to use the right-click to show a popup. This PR enables the `tab_rmb_clicked` signal to always be emitted if you right click a tab, even if `select_with_rmb` is disabled.\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Old Comment</summary>\r\n<p>\r\nCurrently, when users add a popup to a TabContainer, it only adds a small icon on the right that they can click to show the popup. Thus, a common use is to allow right clicks to tabs that also brings up the popup. However, the current method to do this is hacky and requires adding another function. The current method is to connect the tabbar's `gui_input` signal to a new method, in a line like:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d9cd011e2fa9fa9a3011371843729f33032cee35/editor/editor_dock_manager.cpp#L997\r\n\r\nThis PR adds an optional boolean to the popup method that can enable this behavior natively, reducing the amount of extra code and hacky workarounds. It's disabled by default to preserve compatibility.\r\n\r\nI don't know how much the maintainers would want to expose this but I do think that it is a good usability enhancement. Worst case if this doesn't get exposed a boolean could be made with new methods so the existing methods don't get changed.\r\n</p>\r\n</details> ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107440/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}